[[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the\nramp.</p><p>Proceed with removal <a href=\"#/3025363\">4450B10</a> .</p><p>1. Remove the two bevels and undo the nut securing the hub nut to\nthe drive shaft.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Use a 36 mm USAG spanner modified\nas shown in the figure to unscrew the nut.</p></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2004093.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<p>Proceed with removal <a href=\"#/3025319\">4410A80</a> .</p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the driveshaft, complete with\njoints (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2004094.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Place the driveshaft, complete with joints (1a), back in its\nhousing and fix it tightening the bolts (1b) the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>-</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>-</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2004095.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<p>Proceed with refitting <a href=\"#/3025319\">4410A80</a> .</p>"],[27,63,0,"<p>1. Tighten the nut (1a) fixing the wheel hub to the drive shaft\nto the recommended torque, using the angle tightening tool (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>FRONT HUB WITH BEARINGS</p></td><td><p>M24</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Driveshaft side) 6.7 ÷ 7.4 + 60 ÷ 64\n</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Protractor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.942.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2004096.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,63,0,"<p>1. Tighten the nut (1a) fixing the wheel hub to the drive shaft\nto the recommended torque, using the angle tightening tool (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>FRONT HUB WITH BEARINGS</p></td><td><p>M24</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Driveshaft side) 6.7 ÷ 7.4 + 39 ÷ 43\n</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Protractor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.942.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2004096.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,63,0,"<p>1. Bevel the collar of the nut in two places as shown in the figure.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2004097.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,63,0,"<p>Proceed with refitting <a href=\"#/3025363\">4450B10</a> .</p><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p>"]]